window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He would do anything to win his fated mate's heart. Even babysit a flying toddler.</b></p> <p>Corin Blackburn knew single mother Maya Flores was his fated mate from the first time he saw her. But he always told himself she was safer away from him and his dangerous magic. And there was no place for him in her little family. Now, fate has brought them together again—along with her rambunctious baby dragon shifter, a town full of quirky shifters, and his own interfering relatives.</p> <p>He's only here to find out who stole his treasure. But the moment he sees Maya again, he knows the true treasure is the woman he let go without ever telling her what she meant to him.</p> <p>Being the human single mom to a dragon shifter is not the way Maya saw her life going. But she's not the sort to let the unexpected get her down. With the help of her friends, she's made a new life in Hideaway Cove, a magical seaside town where shifters can live without hiding their true natures. Even when their true nature includes stealing their neighbors' silverware.</p> <p>It's not like she misses her old life. Especially not her irritatingly handsome, dragon-shifter ex-boss.</p> <p>Until he arrives in Hideaway Cove in search of stolen treasure… and her.</p> <p>The Duskfire Dragon's Mate <i>is a cozy standalone shifter romance full of heartwarming humor and a generous serving of spice. It's a sweet, steamy listen with a guaranteed HEA!</i></p>"; 
